Placement checklist
• Can the value be resolved on the server? Keep it server-side if no browser interaction needs
ownership.

• Does the browser need to remember it between renders? Then place a client boundary around the
smallest useful region.

• Does it need to survive refresh/navigation? Consider URL/server persistence rather than larger client
state.

• Does it contain protected business truth? The backend remains authoritative regardless of frontend
convenience state.

